      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Having regard to the nature of injuries, period of Sri Kumar B C vs Sri Manjunatha on 27 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/54344009/\n9 hospitalization, nature of treatment given to the claimant and nature of his emp"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "86039b3cc2d74cf8acc008513a555799_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. To prove his income, claimant relied on his income tax returns at Exs.P13 and P14 and the Tribunal has relied on income tax returns at Ex.P15."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8a240a37e0714feb82d4b3dfdf207e4e_126",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per Ex.P15, the income of the claimant for the assessment year 2012-13 was Rs.2,76,112/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "be7e8afd34cd4f2ea7baa690df4d8081_127",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said document shows that the same was submitted on 28.12.2012 i.e. post accident, whereas Exs."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "029d0419c9e44124ac737a08969667dd_128",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "P13 and P14, the income tax returns for the assessment years 2010-11 and 2011-12 respectively were submitted before the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1036157767604c9ca09700c558da7355_129",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore,\nthey are more reliable."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2708e85d7d84425bbf0bec92a6ddca2a_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per Exs.P13 and P14, the - 16 - NC: 2024:KHC:48704-DB income of the claimant for those years was (Rs.2,41,362 +\nRs.2,08,040)=Rs.4,49,402/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "813fc972f4164cd4a66e2f870ffb1d67_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The total income tax for those two years was Rs.8,029/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "73e375433b9c4940a0e34e74f70f64f1_132",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore,\non deducting tax of Rs.8,029/- paid for those two years, his average income of two years comes to Rs.4,41,373 / 2 = Rs.2,20,686.5 rounded off to Rs.2,20,687/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4dc5bc4404c3424f8c3d5e38a8a6bd9b_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Having regard to the age,\nemployment, disability of the claimant and the judgment of the Hon'ble Supreme Court in National Insurance Company Limited Vs. Pranay Sethi & Others1, 25% has to be added to his income by way of future prospects."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a89207a72318457a841f3e8e24d0009a_134",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, his annual income comes to Rs.2,75,859/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7fc1f55d5e124fb0817616caf5a8b171_135",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Applicable multiplier is 13 and disability to be considered is 50%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "38ce11a29365451bbf937b8b2de5464c_136",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, loss of future income comes to (Rs.2,75,859 x 13 x 50%) = Rs.17,93,083/-.\n15."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "245c11fe1e6c44bea141f50e969d1838_137",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Medical expenses of Rs.9,80,000/- was awarded based on the evidence produced by the claimant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "afbc8df6b5f9455db6851f371804faa5_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "That needs to be maintained."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a30f6379c7114ac98d7498103b682ee6_139",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Similarly, the compensation awarded under the head of future medical expenses has to be retained."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "35410e2113c841b2a421830579253660_140",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The compensation awarded on the head of pain and suffering is also just and needs to be maintained."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6823eab4d8c14543854e6b3c129e2415_141",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Considering the nature of the injuries and the period of treatment undergone by the claimant, 2017 (16) SCC 680 - 17 - NC: 2024:KHC:48704-DB the compensation awarded under the head of loss of amenities needs to be enhanced to Rs.1,00,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d867077b890d4c03916ccdb70aff7334_142",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The compensation awarded on the head of diet, conveyance and attendant charges need to be enhanced to Rs.60,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9bb469681218478382581f3dbb596f4f_143",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The just compensation payable is as follows:\n Sl. Particulars Compensation  No. awarded in Rs.\n 1. Loss of future earnings 17,93,083/-\n 2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "86d605b309a047849d5f077c7cc4edb3_144",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Medical expenses 9,80,000/-\n 3. Pain and suffering 1,00,000/-\n 4. Loss of amenities 1,00,000/-\n 5. Diet, conveyance and 60,000/-\n attendant charges  "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "97d41b6d5d354dd2a8fe4f9070c67774_145",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
